From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Saphira forward-port <builder@saphira.vm2.uk>
Date: Thu, 9 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [FWD 7.2.9] proc: numa_maps pmd variant (1/2)

Split of the 032 adaptation, applied first: the pmd-variant hunk. Its
context matches the pte twin exactly, which patch(1) refuses as
ambiguous; trailing context runs to the pmd-only #endif so the hunk is
unique to both applicators. See 032b.

Signed-off-by: Saphira builder <builder@saphira.vm2.uk>
---
diff --git a/fs/proc/task_mmu.c b/fs/proc/task_mmu.c
--- a/fs/proc/task_mmu.c
+++ b/fs/proc/task_mmu.c
@@ -3380,10 +3380,11 @@ static struct page *can_gather_numa_stats_pmd(pmd_t pmd,
 	if (PageReserved(page))
 		return NULL;
 
 	nid = page_to_nid(page);
-	if (!node_isset(nid, node_states[N_MEMORY]))
+	if (!node_isset(nid, node_states[N_MEMORY]) &&
+	    !node_isset(nid, node_states[N_MEMORY_PRIVATE]))
 		return NULL;
 
 	return page;
 }
 #endif
